# Mobile verification evidence: committed manifests are tracked under
# apps/vela-mobile/docs/evidence/. Only local raw artifacts (screenshots,
# logs, captures not committed as evidence) are ignored, in a dedicated
# subdirectory so the evidence root and its manifests remain trackable.
